    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/f0d559ab7772165c2675741e73da2e8e.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tulips &amp; Windmills</strong> is a charming and lighthearted clicker/idle game that immerses you in the iconic Dutch culture! \ud83c\udf37\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your tulip empire as you upgrade your windmill, cultivate vast tulip fields, and unlock the true potential of the Netherlands' most beloved exports. Choose between manually harvesting tulips or hiring skilled gardeners to do the work for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our <strong>Discord</strong> server to help design the game further and stay updated. The link is on the right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/b6ec45ae2a57c583bca6cc63748c5be7.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start with a manual multiplier but get ready for much more! From autoclicker speed and effectiveness over fields and gardener upgrades, make sure to spend your tulips wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/b010b67f97361d065b2b950efba04bda.poster.avif?t=1742033217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/b010b67f97361d065b2b950efba04bda.webm?t=1742033217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/b010b67f97361d065b2b950efba04bda.mp4?t=1742033217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/0981bb322584f4b88618dbe8c52af09c.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At some point, your automation may exceed your manual labor skills, watch your empire flourish while silently expanding and upgrading.\u00a0See your progress as the tulip fields in the background get populated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/5ad18613c964c04d99f59d124dcad340.poster.avif?t=1742033217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/5ad18613c964c04d99f59d124dcad340.webm?t=1742033217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/5ad18613c964c04d99f59d124dcad340.mp4?t=1742033217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/4579b2c38bd3672ef5902f3de3363ed1.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gardeners will help you harvest your fields, they become quicker and quicker! I promise! They will speed to your fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/cfb6226cf74a836c829684d8771329a9.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/a62d81517513a7a8c9da81be3c4906d7.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boost your production with unique Dutch-themed events like <strong>King\u2019s Day</strong> or brave the infamous <strong>Kut Weer!</strong> (bad weather) to turn challenges into opportunities. Upgrade your windmill to increase its speed and efficiency, and watch your tulip fields flourish with ever-growing profits. With every decision, you\u2019ll get one step closer to creating the ultimate Dutch tulip dynasty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/18f12a97cf4f44bbf857e215e80f3506.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multipliers:</strong>\u00a0Upgrade your windmill and tulip fields to maximize profits and speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dutch Events:\u00a0</strong>Celebrate King\u2019s Day, endure bad weather, or embrace the holiday spirit with Sinterklaas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up for a challenge?</strong>\u00a0Change the language to Dutch and see if you can still find all the buttons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong>\u00a0Unlock fun and unique milestones as you grow your tulip empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Save or Reset:</strong>\u00a0Choose to save your progress and continue where you left off before or reset your progress and start from the beginning. Supports <strong>Steam Cloud Saves</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a fan of idle games or just want to bask in the cheerful and vibrant world of tulips and windmills, <strong>Tulips &amp; Windmills</strong> is the perfect game to spend time and enjoy life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Try it now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/7f961c5c2985b3ba509ed5fa18d40722.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/f0d559ab7772165c2675741e73da2e8e.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tulips &amp; Windmills</strong> is a charming and lighthearted clicker/idle game that immerses you in the iconic Dutch culture! \ud83c\udf37\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your tulip empire as you upgrade your windmill, cultivate vast tulip fields, and unlock the true potential of the Netherlands' most beloved exports. Choose between manually harvesting tulips or hiring skilled gardeners to do the work for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our <strong>Discord</strong> server to help design the game further and stay updated. The link is on the right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/b6ec45ae2a57c583bca6cc63748c5be7.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start with a manual multiplier but get ready for much more! From autoclicker speed and effectiveness over fields and gardener upgrades, make sure to spend your tulips wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/b010b67f97361d065b2b950efba04bda.poster.avif?t=1742033217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/b010b67f97361d065b2b950efba04bda.webm?t=1742033217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/b010b67f97361d065b2b950efba04bda.mp4?t=1742033217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/0981bb322584f4b88618dbe8c52af09c.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At some point, your automation may exceed your manual labor skills, watch your empire flourish while silently expanding and upgrading.\u00a0See your progress as the tulip fields in the background get populated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/5ad18613c964c04d99f59d124dcad340.poster.avif?t=1742033217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/5ad18613c964c04d99f59d124dcad340.webm?t=1742033217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/5ad18613c964c04d99f59d124dcad340.mp4?t=1742033217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/4579b2c38bd3672ef5902f3de3363ed1.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gardeners will help you harvest your fields, they become quicker and quicker! I promise! They will speed to your fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/cfb6226cf74a836c829684d8771329a9.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/a62d81517513a7a8c9da81be3c4906d7.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boost your production with unique Dutch-themed events like <strong>King\u2019s Day</strong> or brave the infamous <strong>Kut Weer!</strong> (bad weather) to turn challenges into opportunities. Upgrade your windmill to increase its speed and efficiency, and watch your tulip fields flourish with ever-growing profits. With every decision, you\u2019ll get one step closer to creating the ultimate Dutch tulip dynasty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883980/extras/18f12a97cf4f44bbf857e215e80f3506.avif?t=1742033217\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multipliers:</strong>\u00a0Upgrade your windmill and tulip fields to maximize profits and speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dutch Events:\u00a0</strong>Celebrate King\u2019s Day, endure bad weather, or embrace the holiday spirit with Sinterklaas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Up for a challenge?</strong>\u00a0Change the language to Dutch and see if you can still find all the buttons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong>\u00a0Unlock fun and unique milestones as you grow your tulip empire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Save or Reset:</strong>\u00a0Choose to save your progress and continue where you left off before or reset your progress and start from the beginning. Supports <strong>Steam Cloud Saves</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a fan of idle games or just want to bask in the cheerful and vibrant world of tulips and windmills, <strong>Tulips &amp; Windmills</strong> is the perfect game to spend time and enjoy life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Try it now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste